flowchart LR
  PR[Reviewed source PR] --> Checks[Quality and integration checks]
  Checks --> Security[Secrets / dependencies / IaC / image gates]
  Security --> Merge[Protected main]
  Merge --> Approval[Manual staging approval]
  Approval --> OIDC[GitHub OIDC / ECR-only role]
  OIDC --> Build[Build and scan immutable images]
  Build --> Sign[Sign + SBOM + source/run provenance]
  Sign --> Artifact[Verified release artifact / draft release]
  Artifact --> StagePR[Signature-verified staging promotion PR]
  StagePR --> Stage[Reviewed merge / manual Argo sync]
  Stage --> Evidence[Readiness evidence + operator smoke/SLO review]
  Evidence --> ProdGate[Independent production approval]
  ProdGate --> ProdPR[Exact staged digests / production PR]
  ProdPR --> Prod[Reviewed merge / explicit production sync]
  Terraform[Terraform platform ownership] -. EKS / IAM / ECR .-> OIDC
  Terraform -. No application ownership .-> Stage
